      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW BALLISTA (2) has been out of the placings at his last two outings but shapes well for this if he can recapture his blistering win a few runs back, getting around Geelong over 400m in 22.49. Hard to top on best recent times. GENESIS BALE (3) has a strong record this track and trip with four wins and two placings from 10 starts. In the money last time at this track (22.42) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 2.75 lengths third. Can feature in the finish. PAW YAZ (1) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (22.62) in a Grade 5 at this track. Has a good record here including four wins. Can figure in the finish. DOONGALLA SHANE (5) can sneak into the finish.",
